---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="How Fresh Muse uses affiliate links — full transparency."
>
  <section class="section page-hero">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="lede">Honest links, stated plainly. Last updated: October 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
      <p>
        Fresh Muse is an independent publication. Editorial judgement is not for sale — but some
        links on this site may be affiliate links, and we want you to know that upfront.
      </p>

      <h2>What that means</h2>
      <p>
        If you follow an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission from
        the retailer at no additional cost to you. Commissions help fund the writing and keep this
        site free to read.
      </p>

      <h2>What it doesn't mean</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We are never paid to feature, rank or praise a specific work or artist.</li>
        <li>Affiliate relationships do not influence what we cover, or how we cover it.</li>
        <li>Where a link is affiliate, we mark it or state it in the surrounding text.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Current status</h2>
      <p>
        Fresh Muse currently publishes no affiliate links. When that changes, this page will be
        updated before the first one appears.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Write to <a href="mailto:hello@freshmuse.art">hello@freshmuse.art</a> if anything here is
        unclear.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    background: radial-gradient(60% 120% at 85% -25%, rgba(38, 46, 82, 0.5), transparent 70%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .page-hero .wrap {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
  }

  .section--tight {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  }
</style>
